# ==========================================
# Coding Journey Repository - .gitignore
# ==========================================

# 1. Excluded Specific Subfolders (as requested)
Study & DSA/
[Ss]tudy & [Dd][Ss][Aa]/
[Ss]tudy/
[Dd][Ss][Aa]/

# 2. General System & IDE Files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# 3. C & C++ Artifacts
*.exe
*.obj
*.o
*.out
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.bak
*.swp
*.pdb

# 4. Python Bytecode, Caches & Portable Runtimes
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.env
venv/
env/
ENV/
Python/python.exe
Python/pythonw.exe
Python/*.dll
Python/LICENSE.txt
Python/NEWS.txt

# 5. Java Compiled Binaries & IDE Build Folders
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.log
nbproject/private/
**/build/
**/dist/

# 6. Flutter / Dart Temporary & Build Artifacts
**/.dart_tool/
**/.packages
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/app/build/
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# 7. Sensitive Credential Files
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
